## Title: DMorph |cff33ff99(OctoWoW)|r
## Notes: Morph window for OctoWoW: every creature model in the client (16,000+, with 3D previews, bosses and mounts), every race with NPC looks, 12,000+ items and 352 item sets. Skins for your mount, favourites, and DMorph users see each other's morphs. Type /dmorph. Needs VanillaHelpers v1.1.0+ (OctoLauncher's vanillaHelpers mod); previews need ClassicAPI.
